    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are seagulls and we want fries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab our fries from the waves, grass, and monkey hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw bird droppings at those who stubbornly resist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174740/extras/8aa52e3db26e087666ef13afc6bf7111.poster.avif?t=1748143821\" width=508 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174740/extras/8aa52e3db26e087666ef13afc6bf7111.webm?t=1748143821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174740/extras/8aa52e3db26e087666ef13afc6bf7111.mp4?t=1748143821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, only fries can give you special abilities! (For example: Too spicy can cause feces to catch fire on the ground)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174740/extras/6ad5cd9bd9f0334d78e20d91808d4bd6.poster.avif?t=1748143821\" width=520 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174740/extras/6ad5cd9bd9f0334d78e20d91808d4bd6.webm?t=1748143821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174740/extras/6ad5cd9bd9f0334d78e20d91808d4bd6.mp4?t=1748143821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating instructions: Please click on &quot;View Manual&quot; in the right-hand column.</p>",
